<title>KUWAIT: SOCCER-KUWAIT BEAT SINGAPORE 4-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KUWAIT BEAT SINGAPORE 4-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait beat Singapore 4-0 (halftime 3-0) in a World Cup qualifying match on Thursday:</p>
<p>Scorers: Abdullah Saihan 28, Fawaz al-Ahmad 34, Jassem al-Huwaidi 43, Bashar Abdul-Aziz 78.</p>
